[{"client_msg_id":"2b6e344e-620d-4cab-9451-c6bec0fd5120","type":"message","user":"U02CLFXL19A","text":"user namespaceを生で触れる + root権限持ちだと、一応、コンテナの中の 1000 を 外の1002に、1001を1005に、0を1006に、みたいなmapは作れはしますが、一般運用じゃないっすねぇ","ts":"1635225854.036900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MSw9K"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5912d334-651c-4e9e-9a8d-9bf5311c187c","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"いまのところ user namespace isolation歴まだ2日の初心者です","ts":"1635225759.035400","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1635225775.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eqw4t"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b036ce8e-7970-467f-9cb0-c28ae9a1c2a3","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですです、ここうれしい \u0026gt; 外からみたら一般ユーザの普通のファイル","ts":"1635225747.034800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8ZS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d8d34b30-6004-4417-8684-7b54c83f0ca4","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あーたしかに、確かにそこで狙ってやればいいのか!","ts":"1635225715.034400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MOqv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ce1ff833-cb7a-430f-98af-cb392ad6155e","type":"message","user":"U02CLFXL19A","text":"\u003chttps://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CSM0YPD0B/p1635200006004900\u003e\n\u0026gt; とにかく絶対にcontainer内と外で同じユーザというのが存在しない\n`/etc/subuid` にある範囲のuidに対してuseraddしちゃうと実は作れちゃうという……。\nのと、コンテナ内のroot = コンテナの外の一般ユーザですね。bind mountしてuid/gid=0でファイル作るとコンテナの外から見たときにそのユーザの所有になるので、後片付けが便利","ts":"1635225227.033700","attachments":[{"fallback":"[October 25th, 2021 3:13 PM] u: 露骨に違いを感じるのがこのへん\n• port 80, 443など、rootを必要とするLISTENできない (必要ならhost側で別でなにかやらないといけない)\n• container内と外でuid/gidが違うので、環境変数などでそのまま渡すときは注意 (chmodとかで失敗する)\n• とにかく絶対にcontainer内と外で同じユーザというのが存在しない","id":1,"author_id":"U03C4RC8X","author_name":"ujihisa","author_subname":"ujihisa","author_link":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/team/U03C4RC8X","author_icon":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d9d0ceb387e3b6de5c4562af78e8a910.jpg?s=48\u0026d=https%3A%2F%2Fa.slack-edge.com%2Fdf10d%2Fimg%2Favatars%2Fava_0004-48.png","text":"露骨に違いを感じるのがこのへん\n• port 80, 443など、rootを必要とするLISTENできない (必要ならhost側で別でなにかやらないといけない)\n• container内と外でuid/gidが違うので、環境変数などでそのまま渡すときは注意 (chmodとかで失敗する)\n• とにかく絶対にcontainer内と外で同じユーザというのが存在しない","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"Posted in #tech-container","ts":1635200006.004900,"from_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CSM0YPD0B/p1635200006004900","original_url":"https://vim-jp.slack.com/archives/CSM0YPD0B/p1635200006004900"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"H3h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf58ec22-76fd-4f90-b100-c14737f096c6","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"コンテナごとのはずです! \u003chttps://docs.docker.com/engine/security/userns-remap/\u003e","ts":"1635212898.029400","attachments":[{"fallback":"Docker Documentation: Isolate containers with a user namespace","id":1,"title":"Isolate containers with a user namespace","title_link":"https://docs.docker.com/engine/security/userns-remap/","text":"Isolate containers within a user namespace","image_url":"https://docs.docker.com/images/docs@2x.png","blocks":null,"ts":1634926524,"service_name":"Docker Documentation","service_icon":"https://docs.docker.com/favicons/docs@2x.ico","from_url":"https://docs.docker.com/engine/security/userns-remap/","original_url":"https://docs.docker.com/engine/security/userns-remap/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":2,"users":["UD1FQV38V","U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hg5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15c8206a-a055-4578-957f-74ce7e579344","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"このnon rootはコンテナ毎にuser namespace切るんじゃなくてホスト毎って感じです？それはちょっと使いづらそう...","ts":"1635207068.029000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Txl5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"30cf7c45-1af9-48ab-85c8-9fce808f1749","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"(ただまあそれが本当に必要なシーンってそこまで多くないと思ってる)","ts":"1635201544.027300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"owk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"58e2835a-5d19-465b-a8da-d27dd76d467f","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"なので外部向けサービスという運用するなら、ホストでiptablesとかnginxとかでいい感じにあれしないといけない","ts":"1635201515.026500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NP276"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bf96e945-a39a-4eda-986d-22c423e075cd","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":":desune:","ts":"1635201478.025800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"A5nXo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6fc9782d-1c69-45b2-bac6-0931e94a4526","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ウェルノウンポートがダメってことか","ts":"1635201306.025600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+UgBL"}]},{"client_msg_id":"42910a8e-dd53-48cf-bf4c-8ddac0762696","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"それはキツそう","ts":"1635201274.025000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"SaExK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e29eb17-979b-4f60-8245-e8de0312864f","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あ~そういうことか","ts":"1635201265.024700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BdD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89cc580d-882f-4527-8ab2-559b9bbcbe92","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"port 8080とかだと大丈夫","ts":"1635201060.024500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MTse"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ccf14be8-022a-47d4-8368-fb09c44c537a","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"それでport 80を指定すると実行時に権限がなくて実際にはlistenできてない状態になる","ts":"1635201052.024200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"E3cOr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"08662dbf-54f6-4c74-9d6a-753de524d79e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あ、いや、それ自体はできます!","ts":"1635201024.023600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EIGr3"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adcca1b7-5eda-4e55-bfd1-61d6c3a21881","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"--host なしでやると localhost = コンテナIPアドレスになるのでホストからアクセスできなくなる","ts":"1635200940.023200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1RDn+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10add778-c61b-459a-9d7a-7223b21f173b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"laravel とかだと `php artisan serve --host 0.0.0.0`ってやると、全IPから通信を受けいれるので","ts":"1635200885.022200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Xk9CW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6a7c706d-c4b8-4e71-83c6-bfb0c89ac4f8","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"お、そうなのかな (※僕がマルチキャストアドレス指定をまったく理解していない)","ts":"1635200785.021300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8E8cD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"46f47bad-da0f-463d-a33d-146fcb36ef98","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"\u0026gt; port 80, 443など、rootを必要とするLISTENできない (必要ならhost側で別でなにかやらないといけない)\nこれってマルチキャストアドレス指定したら解決しません?","ts":"1635200607.020400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cMO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"67570a9a-f3da-4c59-b2c8-83dd7cfdb760","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あーまあそのVMをどのユーザ権限で実行してるか、に依存するか (僕自身bsd系いまもってないのでよくわからない)","ts":"1635200592.020000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"I7X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"10baadd9-813b-40c7-8476-4e3d7c33858e","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"cgroupのないbsd系だとそもそもVM経由してるとかなので逆にこれ不要そう。強制的にこれが効いた状態になってるはず(?)なので","ts":"1635200570.019500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B/=m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2d70e359-3ae6-4334-bf21-0c5bfee9cbeb","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"機能的にはdocker自体のものなのでarchlinuxじゃなくてもいけそう \u0026gt; 以外でも","ts":"1635200524.018300","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1635200534.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"yG7Qy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0dc4af38-0ce9-41e9-ae3a-23d6f8dfcec4","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"どうせ動いてしまったら開発してる期間より運用してる期間のほうが長いので、セキュリティ優先したほうが長期的にラクかなと判断してみた感じ","ts":"1635200499.017400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"voY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a582e16c-b3c3-4135-8da5-7b9d91b49080","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あ~なるほど","ts":"1635200461.016600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cdQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4ce8cc66-2b02-4916-b1c5-a1574dc896f6","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"それをなくすというのでどっちが好みかみたいな感じかなー","ts":"1635200451.016100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"a4h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"891178cf-aa30-4c5b-975b-b6dddb010f60","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"dockerが外側のroot権限で実行できるのが、そもそもユーザビリティのためにセキュリティを積極的に犠牲にしてる、という方針なので、","ts":"1635200434.015600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Li"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e28557b8-a177-4020-9084-112f05303faf","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"というか、これLinux以外でも設定できるのかな","ts":"1635200431.015400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6Y5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dfccf173-78f2-46f0-b6c5-112a1b923832","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"\u0026gt; By default, processes in Docker containers run within the same user namespace as the main dockerd daemon, i.e. containers are not isolated by the user_namespaces(7) feature. This allows the process within the container to access configured resources on the host according to Users and groups#Permissions and ownership. This maximizes compatibility, but poses a security risk if a container privilege escalation or breakout vulnerability is discovered that allows the container to access unintended resources on the host. (One such vulnerability was published and patched in February 2019.)\n","ts":"1635200403.014400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jMpoT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e915b916-d18f-4364-ad96-3e5c564d3d14","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"私もやってみようかな","ts":"1635200349.014200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YRW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3749f7f7-2ce6-449b-8417-393e70ef4765","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"個人環境でやるのならありか","ts":"1635200343.014000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Kiic9"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0e5d522c-f029-405e-9883-02403211bb35","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですね。とりあえず僕は試験運用中","ts":"1635200330.013700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VFJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d0dc621d-0f74-4383-aa64-e1918f3e6a94","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"う~ん。これ導入するのまだ面倒な気がするなぁ。IPv6みたいに対応してるものが少ない気がする","ts":"1635200309.013400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8=oI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97826d72-ea40-4220-8a5b-d9c6c250e4c0","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"コンテナ自身が操作できないファイルのpermissionはもちろん削れない","ts":"1635200288.012800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6IPFa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"03b626ba-e876-48d7-917c-1e6cc9a91435","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"あくまでownerが専用のユーザになるというだけなので、コンテナ自身が操作できるファイルのpermissionを削ることはできる","ts":"1635200277.012500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=Gxym"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cb57dc29-17dd-49ff-97e1-5486d72a88e4","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"それに関してはまだありそう","ts":"1635200187.010500","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"majika","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QX+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bcbce5f6-2769-4b93-9a87-693c218c8a12","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"それもなくなるのか","ts":"1635200164.010200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1X+eF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"977caae4-661e-4ed3-8fee-f4148ab60be0","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほど。あとは、たまにコンテナ内で勝手にpermission書き換えられて、ホストからアクセスできないとかありますしね","ts":"1635200159.010000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gSfHk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"4eb5309f-2eea-4f87-ac25-f98889bf67f4","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですです。とくに既存のdockerhubとかにあるcontainer imageのときに。 \u0026gt; トレードフ","ts":"1635200149.009600","edited":{"user":"U03C4RC8X","ts":"1635200155.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6EB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"302a8a28-c928-41f7-9917-d988050daca3","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"bind mountとかしてコンテナ内から外のファイルをいじれるとき、ホスト側にいきなりroot所有のファイルができててびっくりすることがよくあるけど、それが完全になくなる","ts":"1635200107.008400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q4iMy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a5ab30e0-04f0-4ff1-b78a-a23454fce403","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"まぁ確かに、全コンテナを別namespaceで動かせばセキュリティレベルは上がりそうだけど、開発の手間が増えるからトレードオフって感じですね","ts":"1635200106.008300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xAa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5f373305-7eea-43ec-822d-db78c415d3a6","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ですです","ts":"1635200059.006700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"AiK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"544b7699-f247-47b0-8a7f-d9ee521a251a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ってことか","ts":"1635200049.006500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LzF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"23aaf695-9376-4085-84b3-9e7856e6c32a","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ようするにユーザーとおなじnamespaceを使うと意図しないホストリソースを見付けたりする\n→セキュリティレベル低下の原因になる","ts":"1635200046.006100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nKUkw"}]},{"client_msg_id":"87aadba3-67f9-44b5-9c69-a29506734c5f","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"露骨に違いを感じるのがこのへん\n• port 80, 443など、rootを必要とするLISTENできない (必要ならhost側で別でなにかやらないといけない)\n• container内と外でuid/gidが違うので、環境変数などでそのまま渡すときは注意 (chmodとかで失敗する)\n• とにかく絶対にcontainer内と外で同じユーザというのが存在しない","ts":"1635200006.004900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"naruhodo","count":1,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JuUgX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57c1cbff-2756-4a94-9ec1-2f0b960624b2","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"へぇしらなかった。ちょっとみてみようかな","ts":"1635199778.002200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["U03C4RC8X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EBm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89c24079-5919-419d-a45d-9634c4bf3ce6","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"コンテナの中ではrootでも外ではrootではない、みたいな感じになる","ts":"1635199145.001700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"7vWtI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3ac060e3-bd09-4342-84a0-019cf89da0f7","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"ようするにrootではなく一般ユーザでdocker","ts":"1635199128.001300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UsBex"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9cc844ec-88d7-473e-9ea6-ef0eb9c45aeb","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"User namespace isolation","ts":"1635199115.001000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hlC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d76f744-bb0a-4813-b98f-222d5964f98d","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"最近なるべくdockerを \u003chttps://wiki.archlinux.org/title/docker#User_namespace_isolation\u003e で運用してるけど、ちょくちょく罠がありますねえ","ts":"1635199110.000800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"P/P="}]}]
